@startuml
!theme plain
top to bottom direction
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #4A5568
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8F9FA
  BorderColor #4A5568
  FontColor #1A202C
}

title Codex Development Workflow - Adaptive TDD Process

state "Classify task\nTiny / Normal / Complex" as classify_task
state "Understand + Minimal design\n[context-efficiency when needed]" as context
state "Plan / Tickets\n[plan-to-ticket]\nfunction checklist + tests\n+ dependencies + validation" as plan
state "Pick one ready ticket" as ticket
state "Tests / Spec\nconfirm RED when meaningful" as red
state "Implement minimum change" as implement
state "Relevant tests" as tests
state "GREEN?" as green_gate #FFF4CC
state "Failure clear?" as failure_gate #FFF4CC
state "Fix code/test" as fix
state "Targeted review\n[codex review]\nrepeated / unexplained / risky" as targeted_review
state "Design conflict?" as design_gate #FFF4CC
state "Re-plan / split ticket" as replan
state "More tickets?" as more_gate #FFF4CC
state "Integration / regression tests" as integration
state "Repo State / Docs\n[repo-current-state]\nonly if important state changed" as repo_state
state "Classify outputs" as classify_outputs
state "Potentially sensitive?" as sensitive_gate #FFF4CC
state "Redaction\n[data-document-redaction]" as redaction
state "Redaction pass?" as redaction_gate #FFF4CC
state "Final review\n[codex review]\nfinal safe diff" as final_review
state "Blocking finding?" as final_gate #FFF4CC
state "Commit / Push\n[github-push-when-ready]" as publish
state "Blocked" as blocked #FDECEC

[*] --> classify_task
classify_task --> implement : tiny / normal after minimal plan
classify_task --> context : complex
context --> plan
plan --> ticket
ticket --> red
red --> implement
implement --> tests
tests --> green_gate
green_gate --> more_gate : yes
green_gate --> failure_gate : no
failure_gate --> fix : yes
fix --> tests
failure_gate --> targeted_review : no / repeated or unclear
targeted_review --> design_gate
design_gate --> replan : yes
design_gate --> fix : no
replan --> plan
more_gate --> ticket : yes
more_gate --> integration : no
integration --> repo_state
repo_state --> classify_outputs
classify_outputs --> sensitive_gate
sensitive_gate --> redaction : yes
sensitive_gate --> final_review : no
redaction --> redaction_gate
redaction_gate --> final_review : pass
redaction_gate --> blocked : needs_review / blocked
final_review --> final_gate
final_gate --> publish : no
final_gate --> fix : yes / fix + affected tests
publish --> [*]

note right of green_gate
Tests are the normal inner-loop signal.
A failure does not automatically trigger review.
end note

note right of targeted_review
Escalate review only for repeated or
unexplained failures, unclear root cause,
high risk, or architecture conflict.
end note

note right of sensitive_gate
Classify before staging/commit and before
any separate sharing or publication boundary.
end note

note left of classify_task
Use the lightest workflow
that preserves correctness.
end note

@enduml
